+An opt-in native configuration fixture emitter (`AIRK_SELECTED_MEMBERSHIP_REVOKE=1`)
+requires exactly one current native binding, readable project and membership;
+it emits the actual Core RemoveMembership operation and immutable before
+snapshot. It creates no new catalog API or source write authority. All fixture
+indexes require native set-create before W4 binding emission.
+
