+binding, selecting the fault project/index through actual scopeSelect. The
+existing CLI library change retains both compact native ControlResponse lines:
+CatalogPreview followed by fenced CatalogApplied. Core operation identity,
+preview digest, source project/member revisions, actual service/namespace and
+fence lineage must agree. RemoveMembership has authority fencing but no worker
